msgid "Interfaces"
msgstr "Koppelsteden"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QListWidget, listBoxInterfaces)
#: configdlg.ui:31
msgid ""
"This lists the interfaces that you wish to monitor. Please use the names "
"understood by <i>ifconfig</i> ('eth0', 'wlan0', 'ppp0', etc.), or click "
"\"Add all interfaces\" below to include all of the interfaces currently "
"found on your system."
msgstr ""
"Op disse List staht de Koppelsteden, de Du beluern wullt. Bruuk bitte de "
"Naams, as Du ehr för <i>ifconfig</i> bruukst („eth0“, „wlan0“, „ppp0“ usw.), "
"oder klick nerrn op „All Koppelsteden“, wenn Du all Koppelsteden, de sik "
"opstunns op Dien Systeem finnen laat, tofögen wullt."

